# PlanLab generation service — direct runtime and test dependencies.
#
# Installed into the service-only overlay
#   E:/Projects/floorplan-generator/.runtime/generation/site-packages
# with the engine interpreter
#   E:/Projects/floor-plan-model/.python/python.exe
# via
#   scripts/start-generation.ps1 -Setup
#
# torch, numpy and OR-Tools are NOT listed here: they belong to the protected
# engine environment (M/.python/Lib/site-packages) and must never be replaced
# by the overlay. Python standard library unittest is the test runner; pytest
# is deliberately absent.
